    "detailed_description": "<h1>Play The Prologue</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/7666d65b273a46497853c94ef23528d0.avif?t=1754187924\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/f98af55f36b546b39b511c6828ee1748.poster.avif?t=1754187924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/f98af55f36b546b39b511c6828ee1748.webm?t=1754187924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/f98af55f36b546b39b511c6828ee1748.mp4?t=1754187924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Y Life?</strong><br>You have been sentenced to the horrors of: the modern apartment.<br>A mystery spanning 3 - \u221e days in a smart-apartment complex.<br>Request friendship, drink coffee, commit crimes.<br>Or would you break the rules?<br><br><strong>This is not a psychological experiment.</strong><br>Inspired by Phillip K. Dick and the Stanford Prison Experiment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/2510d6b22a4368808f9cac1ecd58a682.poster.avif?t=1754187924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/2510d6b22a4368808f9cac1ecd58a682.webm?t=1754187924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/2510d6b22a4368808f9cac1ecd58a682.mp4?t=1754187924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Walking Simulator With A Gun</strong><br>For the safety of you and the community, THE GUN (safe) is isolated to virtual extermination sessions. You may find relief in THE GUN (safe), but, for moral reasons, it should never become a way of life.<br><br>You may find yourself forced into a path of mindless violence, deception, and soul-crushing retail labor. There is another way, but it will not be handed to you like a morality-simulator for good-boy points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/f2b9a685c24efc1feab0e8cfe52ce654.poster.avif?t=1754187924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/f2b9a685c24efc1feab0e8cfe52ce654.webm?t=1754187924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/f2b9a685c24efc1feab0e8cfe52ce654.mp4?t=1754187924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Multiple Endings</strong><br>During scheduled power outages:<br>1. Remain calm<br>2. Stay inside. <br>Following security protocol ensures you will have a safe and predictable experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/8aca7c3fd9aee62c167a6a31bbe39918.poster.avif?t=1754187924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/8aca7c3fd9aee62c167a6a31bbe39918.webm?t=1754187924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/8aca7c3fd9aee62c167a6a31bbe39918.mp4?t=1754187924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>There Is A Light In The Darkness</strong><br>It will hold your hand.<br>It won't let go. <br>It will punish you for holding on so long.",
